# Conformance probe pack for `uint` fields under `bit_order msb-lsb` (spec
# 0.22). Public. No kinds. Bit order msb-lsb (spec 0.22): positions count from the
# high bit of each byte, a value is assembled from its first bit up.
#
#   bits 0..3     x      the high four bits of byte 0, the highest of them bit 0
#   bits 4..7     y
#   bits 8..15    z
format     conformance-long-mlsb-uint
version    0.22.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
word_bytes 1
bit_order  msb-lsb
field   probe.x  0:0:4  uint
field   probe.y  0:4:4  uint
field   probe.z  0:8:8  uint
